== no header
== header first
  island header 4-25 [\nprop string a = "x"\n]
== whitespace before the header is fine
  island header 10-21 [ ref int n ]
== text before the header: no header
== header without a close runs to the end
  island header 4-18 [\nmethod f() {\n]
== only the first ?> closes it
  island header 4-7 [ a ]
  island tag 16-19 [Tag]
== empty header
  island header 4-4 []
== not <?nv exactly
  island tag 14-17 [Tag]
== empty text
== a NUL byte inside the header
  island header 4-21 [\nprop string a\0b\n]
  island tag 24-27 [Tag]
== a NUL byte in the template
  island header 4-5 [ ]
  island tag 16-19 [Tag]
== components start with a capital letter
  island tag 6-10 [Item]
  island tag 20-28 [Ab-c.d:e]
== an underscore is a letter: <_x> is a tag, never a component
  island tag 6-9 [A_b]
== every start tag counts, closing tags do not
  island tag 1-2 [A]
  island tag 8-9 [B]
  island tag 12-13 [A]
== attributes: quotes, braces and bare values
  island tag 1-5 [Card]
  island tag 50-55 [Inner]
== single quotes and escaped braces in values
  island tag 1-4 [Box]
  island tag 32-36 [Real]
== expressions and comments hide tags
  island tag 43-48 [Shown]
== escaped braces are text
  island tag 4-9 [Shown]
== script and style are raw text, matched without case (a capital <Style> is still a component by its name)
  island tag 42-47 [After]
  island tag 50-55 [Style]
  island tag 74-78 [Last]
== template code islands
  island tag 30-34 [Kept]
== doctype and unknown markup
  island tag 16-20 [Page]
  island tag 36-37 [Y]
== inside the header the tags do not count
  island header 4-40 [\nmethod f() { return "<NotATag/>" }\n]
  island tag 43-46 [Tag]
== unclosed tag
  island tag 1-2 [A]
  island tag 4-5 [B]
== unclosed quote
  island tag 1-2 [A]
== unclosed brace
  island tag 3-4 [A]
  island tag 8-9 [B]
== unclosed comment and code
  island tag 1-2 [A]
== unclosed script
  island tag 1-2 [A]
== lonely angle brackets
  island tag 14-15 [A]
== tag at the very end
  island tag 2-3 [Z]
== attribute without name
  island tag 1-2 [A]
  island tag 11-12 [B]
