== class names
  [/a/Todo.nvh] -> [Todo]
  [/a/my-page.nvh] -> [my_page]
  [C:\site\Hello World.nvh] -> [Hello_World]
  [9lives.nvh] -> [_9lives]
  [.nvh] -> [_]
  [] -> [_]
  [a.b.c.nvh] -> [a_b_c]
  [/x/ünï.nvh] -> [__n__]
  [noext] -> [noext]
  [/a/b/] -> [_]
== declSignature
  body and template edits keep it true, a new field changes it true
== declSignature sees every declaration detail
  a parameter type: changes it true
  a return type: changes it true
  a define member type: changes it true
  a define base class: changes it true
  an added import: changes it true
  a changed import target: changes it true
  a modifier: changes it true
  a field kind (prop to ref): changes it true
  only a method body: changes it false
